      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Read the following announcement and choose the option that best fits each blank.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Warning: Air Pollution in the City</strong></p>\n<p>Attention all residents! The air quality in the city has worsened recently. Here&#8217;s what you need to know:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>&#128663; There are too many cars in the city, so the atmosphere is in a(n) <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-904088-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-904088-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-904088-0'></option><option value=\"green\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-0-green'>green</option><option value=\"fresh\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-0-fresh'>fresh</option><option value=\"unsafe\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-0-unsafe'>unsafe</option><option value=\"miserable\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-0-miserable'>miserable</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;condition.</li>\n<li>&#127787;&#65039; The <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-904088-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-904088-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-904088-1'></option><option value=\"light\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-1-light'>light</option><option value=\"water\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-1-water'>water</option><option value=\"air\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-1-air'>air</option><option value=\"soil\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-1-soil'>soil</option></select></span> </strong>pollution levels have increased so it is difficult to breathe in some areas.</li>\n<li>&#127959;&#65039; Some construction <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-904088-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-904088-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-904088-2'></option><option value=\"materials\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-2-materials'>materials</option><option value=\"costs\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-2-costs'>costs</option><option value=\"workers\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-2-workers'>workers</option><option value=\"sites\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-2-sites'>sites</option></select></span></strong> are noisy, so it may cause noise pollution.</li>\n<li>&#128567; The pollution can cause problems like a<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-904088-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-904088-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-904088-3'></option><option value=\"clear\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-3-clear'>clear</option><option value=\"hot\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-3-hot'>hot</option><option value=\"sore\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-3-sore'>sore</option><option value=\"frozen\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-3-frozen'>frozen</option></select></span></strong> throat or itchy eyes if you're exposed for too long.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>To avoid and reduce the effects of pollution on your health, you should:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Stay indoors when pollution levels are high.</li>\n<li>Wear a mask to protect your lungs and nose.</li>\n<li>Avoid busy streets and construction zones.</li>\n<li>Use public transportation like the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.5</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='4' name='fbo-904088-4' data-testid='fillblank-select-904088-4'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-904088-4'></option><option value=\"plane\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-4-plane'>plane</option><option value=\"truck\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-4-truck'>truck</option><option value=\"rocket\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904088-4-rocket'>rocket</option><option value=\"metro\" data-